    "div" : "<div xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><p class=\"res-header-id\"><b>Generated Narrative: ImplementationGuide smart.who.int.trust-demo</b></p><a name=\"smart.who.int.trust-demo\"> </a><a name=\"hcsmart.who.int.trust-demo\"> </a><div style=\"display: inline-block; background-color: #d9e0e7; padding: 6px; margin: 4px; border: 1px solid #8da1b4; border-radius: 5px; line-height: 60%\"><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\"/><p style=\"margin-bottom: 0px\">Profile: <code>SMARTImplementationGuide</code></p></div><h2>TrustDemo</h2><p>The official URL for this implementation guide is: </p><pre>http://smart.who.int/trust-demo/ImplementationGuide/smart.who.int.trust-demo</pre><div><p>The user journeys of one cross-border family (birth-dose DVCs abroad, CHW triage read, clinic verification and schedule, family VHLs on one phone) as a WHO SMART Guidelines L2 DAK and L3 implementation guide, built on the SMART Trust HCERT libraries.</p>\n</div></div>"
