  "description" : "The user journeys of one cross-border family (birth-dose DVCs abroad, CHW triage read, clinic verification and schedule, family VHLs on one phone) as a WHO SMART Guidelines L2 DAK and L3 implementation guide, built on the SMART Trust HCERT libraries.",
